- rule_name: SANCT_SEP41_ALLOWANCE_NOT_DECREMENTED
  severity: Error
  message: "SANCT_SEP41_ALLOWANCE_NOT_DECREMENTED: `transfer_from` reads the caller's allowance but never writes back a decremented value, so the same approval can be spent repeatedly (SEP-41 violation)"
  location: "transfer_from:16"
  suggestion: "After transferring, persist `allowance - amount` (or call the SDK's allowance-spend helper) before returning"
